8. Conclusion

Wireshark was used to capture live Wi-Fi network traffic and analyze it using HTTP, DNS, TCP, port 80, SYN-flag, and TCP-stream display filters. Packet inspection demonstrated how network protocols operate and how unencrypted HTTP traffic differs from encrypted TLS traffic.

The exercise provided practical experience in packet capture, protocol filtering, packet inspection, and basic network security analysis.

